== Resolution ==
  Neither side was discarded. The two edits were not in opposition:
  one added traceability (which FR specifies this feature), the other
  added substance (what was actually built). Taking either alone would
  have thrown away information a reader needs.

  Resolved to the union: the Requirement column from develop, with the
  prose status from the feature branch.

